    "text": "<p> Match List I with List II </p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/89c08fa5-1c76-4f13-b45d-e993692eeaf6.png\" style=\"width: 525px; height: 235px;\"/></p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :-</p>",
